# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Everything here is optional: the app runs
# fully without any of it, storing a student's grades on their own device.

# ── Supabase (optional) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Enables real accounts so a shortlist follows a student between devices.
# Without these, the app silently uses device-local storage.
# Both values are safe to expose in a browser bundle; the anon key is
# public by design and row-level security is what protects the data.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# ── Email reminders ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# These are NOT read from this file. They are Supabase Edge Function secrets,
# set with `npx supabase secrets set NAME=value`, and are listed here only so
# the names are in one place. Never prefix any of them with VITE_ — that would
# inline them into the browser bundle, where the service role key in particular
# would hand any visitor every student's data.
#
#   RESEND_API_KEY                 from resend.com
#   REMINDER_FROM_EMAIL            defaults to UniMatch Ghana <noreply@unimatchgh.app>
#   REMINDER_UNSUBSCRIBE_SECRET    long random string; signs unsubscribe links.
#                                  Changing it invalidates links already sent.
#
# There is no cron secret here on purpose. The database generates its own into
# Vault (migration 0004) and both sides read it from there, so it never needs to
# be copied between two places or held by a person.

# ── SMS / WhatsApp reminders (not yet connected) ─────────────────────────────
# The toggles are built but disabled until these exist. Africa's Talking has a
# free sandbox for development but no production free tier.
AFRICASTALKING_USERNAME=
AFRICASTALKING_API_KEY=
WHATSAPP_PHONE_NUMBER_ID=
WHATSAPP_ACCESS_TOKEN=
